WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:06.064
Letter Dash is a fast word game. You can play it alone, or with up to ten people.

2
00:00:06.764 --> 00:00:16.124
Each round gives you one letter and six categories. Your job is to write an answer for every category, and each answer has to start with that letter.

3
00:00:16.274 --> 00:00:19.209
Type fast, hit done, or wait for the timer.

4
00:00:19.909 --> 00:00:24.866
Then everyone's answers are shown, and you can flag any that don't fit the category.

5
00:00:25.016 --> 00:00:32.472
Unique answers score ten points. If a friend wrote the same thing, you each get five. Flagged answers score nothing.

6
00:00:33.172 --> 00:00:37.368
So think of the weird ones, because nobody else is going to write them.
